{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくぞ！ (๑╹∀╹๑)きらきら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュ！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/30/4779692/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/30/4779692/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょーさん走りつづけます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/30/4779692/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわっ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜個別握手会、\n来てくれたあみあみ族のみんなありがとーっっ\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりあみあみ族最高すぎます。\nね、ね、ね。\nめっちゃ楽しい❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず椅子持ち上げたよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/30/4779692/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たーのーしーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと6thの握手会まで日にち空いちゃうけど、みんなあみの顔忘れないでね((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆大好きなみくもへ☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくもと始めて会ったのは、実は乃木坂が始まるよりずっとずっと前で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未がまだ小学校3年生の時だったっけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"市民ミュージカルで一緒になって、その時からすでに親同士も愛未達も仲良しになったんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから何年もたって、まさかの乃木坂で再会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ること、歌うことが大好きなみくも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くったくのない笑顔のみくも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の卒業もみくもは真剣に考えて出した結論なんだよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当のこというとやめてほしくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと一緒にいろんな舞台に立ちたかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、みくもが真剣に出した結論ならあみは止めないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業してもずっと大切な大切な仲間だからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくも！！！！！！大好き！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、今日のドレス姿のみくも可愛すぎ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/30/4779692/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあんた、婚期遅れるわよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは！！！\n明日も朝から稽古があるので、わたしは......お風呂に入ってくる)^o^("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/30/4779692/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日質問答えてくれてありがとーお❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふむふむって思ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースが好きって方が多いようで  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるほどねーん...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふむふむぬくぬくあわあわ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/30/4779692/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ず、ずーさん。"}],"source":"archive"}